      * CREDITO APLICAN PARA ACUERDO DE PAGO O NO                      *
      ******************************************************************
       2124-CONS-ACUE-PAGO-UR.
           INITIALIZE URWCVRCR
           MOVE '1'                          TO VRCR-OPCION
           MOVE MAE-ENTIOFI                  TO VRCR-ENTIOFI
           MOVE MAE-CUENTA                   TO VRCR-CUENTA

           CALL  BBVA-UR9CVRCR   USING   URWCVRCR

           EVALUATE VRCR-RETORNO
              WHEN CTE-CON-00
                 IF VRCR-REGLAS  EQUAL CTE-CON-S
                    PERFORM 2125-CONS-ACUE-PAGO-RV
                 END-IF
               WHEN OTHER
                  MOVE CTE-UGE0939           TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                  MOVE 'ERROR RUT. UR9CVRCR' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                  MOVE VRCR-RETORNO          TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:2)
                  MOVE VRCR-VAR-ERROR1(1:18) TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(3:)
                  PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
           END-EVALUATE.
