              MOVE 'UGE0939'        TO CAA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'UR2CIEN0'       TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE IEN-TABLENAME    TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR(10:)
              MOVE 'SQLCODE '       TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:8)
              MOVE IEN-SQLCODE      TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(9:)
              PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *COL31F
