      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       2247-LIQUIDA-CUPOS.
      *
           IF WS-INDINANT = 'A' OR 'P'
              MOVE 'UGE0161'                  TO CAA-COD-ERROR
              PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
           END-IF.
