              PERFORM 27A-VAL-T37-SANCION
              PERFORM 27C-CALC-MAS-PA
              IF WS-INDICADORT37 = 1
                COMPUTE WS-MES-TOTAL2 = WS-MES-TOTAL1 * WS-IND12
                COMPUTE WS-SUMAIMPMOVI = WS-SUMAIMPMOVI + G07-IMPORTE
                IF  WS-MES-TOTAL2  <  G07-IMPORTE    OR
                    WS-MES-TOTAL2  <  WS-SUMAIMPMOVI
      *@COL36-F
                   PERFORM 22452-VALOR-COMISION
