              MOVE 'UGDTMOD'                  TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'INSERT-'                  TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
              MOVE MOD-TABLA                  TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(8:8)
              MOVE MOD-COLUMNA                TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(16:5)
      *COL31I
      *       PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
