      *NOVA02-F
           MOVE  MOV-ENTIOPE(1:4)     TO IFA-UGCENTIT
           MOVE  MOV-ENTIOPE(5:4)     TO IFA-UGCOFINC
           MOVE  CAA-NETNAME-CONT     TO IFA-NETNAME-UMO
           MOVE  CAA-USERID           TO IFA-USERID-UMO
           MOVE  CAA-ENTIDAD          TO IFA-ENTITAT-UMO
