      ******************************************************************
      *              244-ACTULIZAR-CDE                                 *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *    ACTUALIZA LA TABLA DE DETALLE DE MOVIMIENTOS DE CUPOS DE    *
      *    PRESTAMOS.                                                  *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       244-ACTUALIZAR-CDE.
      *
           PERFORM 2441-LLENAR-DATOS-CDE.
           PERFORM 2442-INSERTAR-UGDTCDE.
      *
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *              2441-LLENAR-DATOS-CDE                             *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *    - MUEVE LAS VARIABLES DE TRABAJO A LOS CAMPOS DE LA TABLA   *
      *      DE DETTALLE DE MOVIMIENTOS DE CUPOS.                      *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       2441-LLENAR-DATOS-CDE.
      *
           INITIALIZE                         UGVCCDE0.
           MOVE CMA-ENTIOFI                   TO CDE-ENTIOFI
           MOVE CMA-CUENTA                    TO CDE-CUENTA
           MOVE CMA-ENTIOFI                   TO CDE-ENTIOFI
      *
           ADD  1                             TO CMA-CONSEC-DETALLE
           MOVE CMA-CONSEC-DETALLE            TO CDE-NRO-OPER
           MOVE 1                             TO CDE-CONSEC
           MOVE 'TF'                          TO CDE-CANAL
           MOVE CAA-FECHA-OPER2               TO CDE-FECHA-OPER
           MOVE CAA-FECHA-CONT2               TO CDE-FECHA-CONT
      *@COL84-i
           IF SI-PAGO-SW
              MOVE WS-DB2-FEVALOR             TO CDE-FECHA-CONT
                                                 CDE-FECHA-OPER
           END-IF
      *@COL84-f
           MOVE '0002'                        TO CDE-TIPO-MOV
           MOVE ZEROS                         TO CDE-NRO-RECIBO
           MOVE ZEROS                         TO CDE-CONS-GASTO
           MOVE SPACES                        TO CDE-TIPO-GASTO
           MOVE WS-MES-IMPORTE                TO CDE-IMP-CAPITAL
           MOVE WS-MES-INTERESE               TO CDE-IMP-INT-CTES
           MOVE ZEROS                         TO CDE-IMP-INT-MORA
           MOVE WS-MES-GASTOS                 TO CDE-IMP-GASTOS
           MOVE WS-MES-COMISION               TO CDE-IMP-COMISION
           MOVE WS-MES-IVA                    TO CDE-IMP-IVA
           MOVE ZEROS                         TO CDE-IMP-SEGUROS
           MOVE 'UG'                          TO CDE-APLIC-DESTINO
      *
           IF G07-CAJA = 'N' OR SPACES OR LOW-VALUES OR '0'
              MOVE 'CU'                       TO CDE-IND-TIPO-PAGO
              MOVE MIR-NUMER-MOV              TO CDE-NRO-MOVMIR
              IF G07-CCCARGO EQUAL SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
                 MOVE MAE-ENTIDAD-VIN         TO CDE-CTA-DESTINO(1:4)
                 MOVE MAE-CENTRO-VIN          TO CDE-CTA-DESTINO(5:4)
                 MOVE MAE-DIGICCC1-VIN        TO CDE-CTA-DESTINO(9:1)
                 MOVE MAE-DIGICCC2-VIN        TO CDE-CTA-DESTINO(10:1)
                 MOVE MAE-CUENTA-VIN          TO CDE-CTA-DESTINO(11:10)
              ELSE
                 MOVE G07-CCCARGO             TO CDE-CTA-DESTINO
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE 'EF'                       TO CDE-IND-TIPO-PAGO
              MOVE ZEROS                      TO CDE-NRO-MOVMIR
              MOVE SPACES                     TO CDE-CTA-DESTINO
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-SALREAL-INICIAL            TO CDE-SALDO-CAP-ANT
           MOVE CMA-SALDO-INTPER              TO CDE-SALDO-INT-ANT
           MOVE CMA-DISPONIBLE                TO CDE-DISPONIBLE-ANT
           MOVE SPACES                        TO CDE-CODIDENT
           MOVE SPACES                        TO CDE-CLAIDENT
