           PERFORM  LLAMAR-TC1C1220
           MOVE WS-DIAS              TO WS-VALOR-FEULIQ

           COMPUTE  WS-CAPITAL ROUNDED = WS-CUOTAFINAL

           PERFORM 991-LLAMADO-UR8CFIN0
           COMPUTE WS-CUOTAFINAL-INT = FIN-INTERES + WS-CUOTAFINAL

           SET SW-CUOTAFIN-OK              TO TRUE
      *COL81-I
