      *                        ((1 + WS-INTER-PER) ** COT-TOT-AMORT-PEN)
      *        ELSE
      *          COMPUTE WS-CUOTAFINUE = (WS-CUOTAFINAL - G07-CAPITAL) *
      *                                   (1 + WS-INTER-PER)
      *        END-IF
      *COL81-F
           END-IF.
      *
           IF SW-CUOTAFIN-OK
              MOVE MAE-FEVENCIN(1:4)             TO G071-VENCI3(7:4)
              MOVE '/'                           TO G071-VENCI3(6:1)
              MOVE MAE-FEVENCIN(6:2)             TO G071-VENCI3(4:2)
