              IF COT-CODIGO       =  CTE-CON-99
                  MOVE 'UGE1590'             TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                  MOVE COT-CODIGO            TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                  MOVE 'UR1CCOT0'            TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                  PERFORM  3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
