      ******************************************************************
       24450-LLAMA-RUT-DAT-PAG-ANT.
           INITIALIZE                             URWCDPA
           MOVE CTE-ALFA-1                     TO DPA-OPCION
           MOVE MAE-CCC                        TO DPA-CCC
