      ******************************************************************
       27C-VAL-T37-SANCION.
           MOVE '4070'                      TO T37-SECCION
           MOVE MAE-ENTIOFI                 TO T37-ELEMENTO(01:08)
           MOVE MAE-CUENTA                  TO T37-ELEMENTO(09:)
