      ******************************************************************
       8800-ACTUALIZAR-UGDTSWP.
      *
           PERFORM 21511-SELECT-UGDTSWP2
           PERFORM 2391-GRABAR-LOG-SWP
KJMR       IF WS-ACUMU-N EQUAL ZEROS
              PERFORM 262000-CAMPOS-CONTROL-ANULA
KJMR       END-IF
           PERFORM 2391-SELECT-ESTADOS.
