              MOVE WS-DB2-FEVALOR             TO GDL2-FECHA-OPER
           ELSE
              MOVE CAA-FECHA-OPER2            TO GDL2-FECHA-OPER
           END-IF

           CALL BBVA-UR9CGDL2              USING UGWCGDL2-01            00194294
           EVALUATE GDL2-CODIGO-RETORNO
               WHEN '00'
      *        CORRECTO
                   CONTINUE
               WHEN '50'
      *        SUBPRODUCTO NO ES LH
                   CONTINUE
               WHEN '99'
      *        ERROR ACCESO DB2
                   MOVE 'UGE0939'         TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                   MOVE 'UR9CGDL2-'       TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR (1:9)
                   MOVE 'ACCESO DB2'      TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR (10:10)
                   MOVE 'RETORNO: '       TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR (1:9)
                   MOVE GDL2-COD-SQLCODE  TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR (10:3)
                   PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                   PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE 'UGE0939'                TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                   MOVE GDL2-VAR1-ERROR          TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                   MOVE GDL2-VAR2-ERROR          TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
                   MOVE GDL2-COD-SQLCODE         TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(12:)
                   PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                   PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
           END-EVALUATE.
